Glad you contacted to us regarding the cancellation of your {{Credit Card}}. I understand that you no longer want to continue with your {{Credit Card}} and I'd be happy to assist you with canceling it.

To proceed with the cancellation, we will need some specific information from you. Please provide the following details:

1. Full name on the card: {{Cardholder Name}}
2. {{Credit Card}} number: {{Visa Card Number}}
3. Expiration date: {{Expiration Date}}
4. Security code (CVV): {{CVV}}

Once you provide the required details, our team will process your cancellation request and ensure it is completed as soon as possible. Please note that any outstanding balances or pending transactions on your {{Credit Card}} will need to be settled before the cancellation can be finalized.

If you have any additional questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to let me know.

